    <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-180" contextRef="c-06">&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;A.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 6pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Nature of Operations&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The respondent operates a high pressure natural gas transmission line in the Northern DJ Basin consisting of approximately 16 miles of 6&amp;quot; steel and 14 miles of 8&amp;quot; steel. The pipeline extends from Laramie County WY to northern Weld County CO, of which approximately 26 miles are located in WY and 4 miles in CO.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;B.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 6pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The respondent is organized as a limited liability company and taxed as a partnership for federal income tax purposes. As a result, income or losses are taxable or deductible to the members rather than at the respondent level; accordingly, no provision has been made for federal income taxes in the accompanying financial statements. &lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;C.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 6pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Allocated expenses&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;All expenses are allocated from parent entity, Roaring Fork Midstream, LLC.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
    <ferc:AccumulatedProvisionForDepreciationAmortizationAndDepletionOfPlantUtility id="f-182" contextRef="c-18" unitRef="u-02" decimals="0">0</ferc:AccumulatedProvisionForDepreciationAmortizationAndDepletionOfPlantUtility>
